  "body_html": "<h1>Optimal Strategy Sets</h1>\n<p>For a matrix game $A$, let $X(A)$ be the subset of $\\Delta(I)$ consisting of\noptimal strategies of player 1, and let $Y(A)$ be the subset of $\\Delta(J)$\nconsisting of optimal strategies of player 2.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[MFoGT, Prop. 2.4.1] Laraki, Renault, and Sorin, <em>Mathematical Foundations of Game Theory</em>, <code>references/MechDesign.pdf</code>. Definition of X(A) and Y(A), the optimal strategy sets.</li>\n</ul>",
